# Post-implementation verify loop

Run after plan or scope implementation (in order):

1. **Build** — `pnpm build` from repo root (skip when docs/plans-only)
2. **Dev** — `pnpm dev` (or project dev command); check logs for compile/runtime errors
3. **Tests** — run project test command when scope touched testable code
4. **Secrets grep** — `node scripts/tools/check-sensitive-log-patterns.js` when scripts or config changed (if present)
5. **Handoff brief** — per `handoff-and-scope-loop.mdc` when plan close-out applies
6. **Owner checklist** — update per `owner-checklist-agent-edits.mdc` when applicable; report in brief

Skip steps explicitly N/A. Do not leave verify failures unresolved.
